# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Signing secrets
# The bundled keystore/pacebeat.jks is an intentionally public demo key
# (password: pacebeat) used by this sample project, so it stays tracked.
# Never add a real production keystore or its passwords here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
!keystore/pacebeat.jks

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Intentionally tracked (do not ignore)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
